1
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:12,723
Sessions & matches shows your whole week. Each day is tagged against the next match: MD-4, MD-1, match day.

2
00:00:12,723 --> 00:00:18,279
Right below, the week’s attendance: who trained, who missed, at a glance.

3
00:00:18,279 --> 00:00:23,257
Open any session or match. Here, last Saturday’s match.

4
00:00:23,257 --> 00:00:30,356
18 players confirmed, 1 is unsure. Answers arrive automatically from WhatsApp, email or the player app.

5
00:00:30,356 --> 00:00:37,066
The Players tab lists everyone called up, with their answer and any note they left.

6
00:00:37,066 --> 00:00:38,885
Close the panel when you’re done.

7
00:00:38,885 --> 00:00:44,022
To schedule something new, click + Event and choose a type.

8
00:00:44,022 --> 00:00:49,194
Let’s book a video session before the next match: pick Meeting.

9
00:00:49,194 --> 00:00:56,411
Fill in the essentials: title, date, time, duration and place.

10
00:00:56,411 --> 00:01:03,505
Next, the call-up: the whole active squad is selected — switch to Selection to pick players.

11
00:01:03,505 --> 00:01:09,429
Players confirm before the deadline, and this is the exact message they’ll receive.

12
00:01:09,429 --> 00:01:16,110
Create the event. The call-up goes out on its own — no group chat needed.

13
00:01:16,110 --> 00:01:22,055
Here it is on Monday. Answers will fill in here as players reply.

14
00:01:22,055 --> 00:01:28,762
Call-ups tracks every send: what went out, what’s scheduled and who still has to answer.

15
00:01:28,762 --> 00:01:35,832
Need to nudge latecomers? On any event, Send reminder only reaches players who haven’t answered yet.
